      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹5.08 (vs ₹7.07 in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹5.08 (down from ₹7.07 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹627.8m (down 15% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹35.4m (down 28% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 5.6% (down from 6.7% in 3Q 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by lower revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 18% per year whereas the company’s share price has increased by 20% per year.",
